     "notes": {
      "text": "White has put two pawns in the centre. Play 2...d5 as planned: it attacks e4, and if 3.exd5 cxd5 you have swapped your c-pawn for White's central e-pawn. Other moves are rare: 2...d6 transposes to a Pirc, and 2...Nf6!? invites 3.e5!, chasing the knight.",
